Subject: [PATCH 01955/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE B1 (OWED
 pivot; RETIRE live-LoRA + OFFLINE harness smoke) -- the live-LoRA
 verifier-as-reward path has now failed 6x on INFRA (exp4198 bg-death, exp4199
 gate-block, exp4211 PEFT attach, exp4222/exp4223 DURATION short-circuits,
 exp4234 blocked_lora_training_cannot_run_in_window) and NEVER reached
 science; the operator's accumulate-floor (3 consecutive no-usable windows) is
 long since met. RETIRE the live-LoRA path (live_lora_retired BARE bool=true)
 and PIVOT to an OFFLINE reward-weighted form that FITS THE WINDOW: precompute
 per-example reward weights from the intact A/B/C corpora, then run a BOUNDED
 offline reward-weighted LoRA-SFT (RAFT/reward-weighted-regression/filtered-BC
 -- a finite, deterministic-step training, NOT open-ended live RL). SMOKE it
 as a POSITIVE CONTROL that PROVES real training: LoRA attaches with >0
